WEBVTT

00:27.160 --> 00:30.560
♪Peach blossoms fall,
yesterday's trace fades away♪

00:30.800 --> 00:34.080
♪Ahead lie storms and winds,
our fates like drifting clouds sway♪

00:34.400 --> 00:40.040
♪Alas, I roam through what remains,
fate's grip won't set me free♪

00:41.400 --> 00:44.920
♪If time would spare me
just one breath to stay♪

00:45.520 --> 00:48.920
♪If you could see
the depth of my belief♪

00:49.120 --> 00:55.680
♪Alone I enter the game,
every move made with no regret in me♪

00:56.080 --> 01:00.040
♪Though shackles bind my soul
and chain my form♪

01:00.160 --> 01:03.240
♪I've walked
through life and death before♪

01:03.320 --> 01:10.200
♪I fear not fate's cruel temptations,
I've severed every cause♪

01:10.400 --> 01:14.440
♪In this life our threads entwined,
in love and pain we crossed♪

01:14.600 --> 01:17.480
♪But I'll keep my word
no matter the cost♪

01:17.560 --> 01:19.960
♪Forged in stardust and flame♪

01:20.040 --> 01:25.800
♪I rise with an unyielding frame♪

01:35.120 --> 01:36.960
=The Princess's Gambit=

01:37.040 --> 01:39.440
(Adapted from the novel "Peach Blossoms
Reflecting the River and Mountains")

01:39.520 --> 01:42.000
(by Bai Lu Cheng Shuang)

01:42.160 --> 01:44.920
=Episode 21=

01:48.520 --> 01:49.760
(Serene and Tasteful)

01:52.000 --> 01:52.680
A bunch of useless fools!

01:53.720 --> 01:54.880
Can't even handle something this simple!

01:55.880 --> 01:56.680
Get out of my sight!

01:59.960 --> 02:01.760
(What has Prince Wuyin so enraged?)

02:02.480 --> 02:03.880
(Did something happen?)

02:05.040 --> 02:05.640
What's all

02:06.200 --> 02:07.000
this noise for?

02:07.800 --> 02:08.880
Do you not know His Highness is inside?

02:09.960 --> 02:10.560
Qingfeng.

02:10.919 --> 02:12.960
A cart of ripe fruit just arrived
from the manor.

02:13.400 --> 02:14.720
We thought to present it
to His Highness for a taste.

02:15.480 --> 02:16.600
The Beiyuan delegation had only
just entered the city

02:17.040 --> 02:18.320
when they were stopped
by that treacherous chancellor.

02:18.720 --> 02:19.800
His Highness is in a fury over it.

02:21.200 --> 02:24.320
(Why did Shen Zaiye stop
the Beiyuan delegation?)

02:25.680 --> 02:27.440
(Is he still trying
to entangle himself with me?)

02:28.720 --> 02:30.600
(Prince Wuyin already resents
this entire affair.)

02:31.280 --> 02:33.000
(If this leads him to send me
back to Beiyuan,)

02:33.800 --> 02:34.640
(what am I to do?)

02:34.720 --> 02:35.440
You'll get nothing

02:35.760 --> 02:36.640
out of going in now.

02:36.760 --> 02:37.360
Be gone.

02:37.440 --> 02:38.040
Understood.

03:06.840 --> 03:08.960
(Envoy Lodging)

03:13.480 --> 03:14.200
You are

03:14.880 --> 03:15.960
the Left Chancellor of Qi,

03:16.440 --> 03:17.320
Shen Zaiye?

03:18.440 --> 03:19.520
All of you have

03:20.560 --> 03:21.160
traveled far.

03:29.840 --> 03:30.480
Shen Zaiye!

03:31.480 --> 03:32.680
What is the meaning of this?

03:33.440 --> 03:34.360
If you can't give us an explanation,

03:34.560 --> 03:36.480
Beiyuan will not let this matter rest!

03:36.560 --> 03:38.760
Wang Yuanqi, Vice Minister of Rites.

03:39.160 --> 03:41.000
Empress Lv's trusted aide.

03:44.520 --> 03:45.120
Take him away.

03:46.160 --> 03:46.760
You…

03:46.960 --> 03:47.680
Shen Zaiye,

03:47.800 --> 03:49.320
I'm the head of the Beiyuan delegation!

03:49.600 --> 03:50.640
How dare you!

03:51.120 --> 03:51.840
How dare you!

03:51.920 --> 03:53.000
- I'll make you pay for this!
- What is going on?

03:53.240 --> 03:54.560
Does he intend to kill us all?

03:56.440 --> 03:57.560
We've asked you here today

03:58.400 --> 04:00.440
to discuss matters
concerning Princess Chengping.

04:01.520 --> 04:02.760
You were all once acquainted with her

04:03.040 --> 04:04.480
in the royal palace of Beiyuan.

04:04.880 --> 04:06.360
It was rumored

04:07.480 --> 04:10.240
that Princess Chengping
was executed in Qi as a spy.

04:11.120 --> 04:11.960
Executed?

04:12.440 --> 04:14.240
Are they trying to root out
her alleged accomplices?

04:16.519 --> 04:17.240
Chancellor, please judge wisely.

04:17.600 --> 04:19.040
None of us ever treated her kindly.

04:21.160 --> 04:21.760
That's right.

04:22.280 --> 04:23.440
She had a sharp tongue.

04:23.600 --> 04:24.840
I once deprived her of food

04:25.000 --> 04:26.320
for three days to temper her spirit.

04:26.520 --> 04:28.400
I left only a bowl of chili water
in her room.

04:30.320 --> 04:31.800
Forced her to survive on chili water?

04:33.320 --> 04:34.520
That's certainly creative.

04:35.120 --> 04:35.720
And I as well.

04:36.320 --> 04:38.440
That wretched girl could never
keep her legs from wandering.

04:38.880 --> 04:39.760
I beat the soles of her feet

04:40.080 --> 04:41.120
with a cane until they bled.

04:41.600 --> 04:42.960
Even locked in her room,
she'd keep screaming

04:43.160 --> 04:44.040
about rats and snakes.

04:44.320 --> 04:45.520
Once I got fed up,

04:45.760 --> 04:47.280
I threw in
a few centipedes and scorpions.

04:47.640 --> 04:48.680
That shut her up.

04:49.160 --> 04:51.040
I've slapped her, docked her allowance,

04:51.160 --> 04:52.160
and never once gave her medicine.

04:52.560 --> 04:53.960
One winter,
she appeared before Empress Lv,

04:54.040 --> 04:54.840
slouching

04:55.240 --> 04:56.360
and complaining about the cold.

04:56.760 --> 04:57.920
I had her kneel on ice

04:58.160 --> 04:59.160
until it all melted away.

05:00.560 --> 05:02.800
Girls of noble birth in Yujing
are mostly spoiled.

05:03.360 --> 05:05.560
To be merely unruly is already a mercy.

05:06.840 --> 05:08.600
You're a legitimate princess of Beiyuan.

05:09.200 --> 05:10.880
How did you end up
so calculating and careful?

05:12.400 --> 05:13.520
Being a legitimate princess meant

05:13.960 --> 05:15.680
every word and action of mine
was closely watched.

05:16.600 --> 05:17.720
That is why I learned

05:18.240 --> 05:19.480
to see the subtle signs in all things.

05:23.080 --> 05:23.960
Good.

05:25.880 --> 05:26.920
Very good.

05:28.800 --> 05:29.440
Zhan Lu.

05:31.240 --> 05:32.000
Detain them.

05:33.760 --> 05:34.360
Take them away.

05:35.120 --> 05:36.160
Chancellor!

05:36.240 --> 05:37.520
- Mercy, Chancellor!
- Please spare me!

05:38.200 --> 05:39.320
- Chancellor!
- Mercy, Chancellor!

05:39.520 --> 05:40.560
- Mercy, Chancellor!
- Chancellor!

05:45.680 --> 05:46.600
Did you hear?

05:46.680 --> 05:48.360
Chancellor Shen is interrogating
the Beiyuan people.

05:48.520 --> 05:49.480
I heard those were the ones

05:49.560 --> 05:51.160
who mistreated Princess Chengping.

05:51.720 --> 05:53.840
Sounds like he's using torture, too.

06:00.600 --> 06:01.200
Get in there.

06:01.280 --> 06:01.880
Quickly!

06:02.560 --> 06:03.360
Hurry up!

06:05.560 --> 06:06.200
Get down and stop squirming.

06:06.560 --> 06:07.200
Move, and I'll strike you.

06:12.520 --> 06:13.120
Sir.

06:13.280 --> 06:14.240
Word's already out.

06:14.720 --> 06:16.160
Crowds are forming outside to watch.

06:17.320 --> 06:18.960
Who exactly are we leaking
all this information for?

06:19.840 --> 06:20.640
Why do you care?

06:21.120 --> 06:22.280
Talk less, do more.

06:22.400 --> 06:23.000
Yes, sir.

06:25.520 --> 06:26.640
Princess Chengping is here.
She's at the entrance.

06:33.920 --> 06:35.160
I think I heard screaming just now.

06:36.520 --> 06:37.560
Serves them right for offending

06:37.880 --> 06:38.840
the treacherous chancellor.

06:38.920 --> 06:39.640
Open the side entrance.

06:39.720 --> 06:40.720
- Yes, sir.
- That's right.

06:40.800 --> 06:41.880
They were apprehended
as soon as they entered the city.

06:55.840 --> 06:57.280
(Her Highness caught on swiftly.)

06:59.160 --> 06:59.760
Chancellor.

07:00.040 --> 07:01.480
You'd better remember this favor.

07:23.960 --> 07:24.720
Speak.

07:25.120 --> 07:26.640
What do you wish to know?

07:27.760 --> 07:28.560
The more detail, the better.

07:28.800 --> 07:29.400
Princess Chengping was sweet

07:29.760 --> 07:31.040
and well-behaved from a young age,

07:31.560 --> 07:32.760
always dearly loved.

07:33.480 --> 07:34.760
Sweet and well-behaved?

07:36.440 --> 07:37.600
Dearly loved?

07:39.880 --> 07:40.520
Take her away.

07:42.040 --> 07:42.640
Mercy, Chancellor!

07:42.720 --> 07:44.640
(That treacherous chancellor
is digging into my past.)

07:45.560 --> 07:46.880
Mercy, Chancellor!

07:48.600 --> 07:49.280
(Ling.)

07:50.080 --> 07:50.680
(Lan.)

07:51.360 --> 07:52.440
(Xiaoxizi.)

07:53.880 --> 07:55.520
(What exactly
is Shen Zaiye trying to do?)

07:56.280 --> 07:57.440
And the three of you?

07:59.400 --> 08:00.000
It's said

08:00.400 --> 08:01.480
that ever since the late empress passed,

08:01.880 --> 08:03.880
Princess Chengping's status plummeted.

08:04.520 --> 08:06.000
She and her younger brother

08:06.400 --> 08:07.520
could hardly survive in the palace.

08:09.840 --> 08:10.720
I remember.

08:11.880 --> 08:13.320
When the late empress died,

08:14.640 --> 08:15.960
the princess was only seven.

08:17.120 --> 08:19.240
She held the hand
of the four-year-old Prince Changjue,

08:20.480 --> 08:22.240
both of them crying so hard

08:23.720 --> 08:25.280
it broke my heart.

08:27.040 --> 08:27.640
Go on.

08:30.000 --> 08:31.280
Just as you know,

08:31.960 --> 08:33.280
while the late empress was alive,

08:33.720 --> 08:35.880
His Majesty did favor Her Highness.

08:37.159 --> 08:37.960
But after her passing,

08:38.640 --> 08:40.480
Princess Chengping and Prince Changjue

08:40.760 --> 08:42.200
were sent to the Cold Palace.

08:43.360 --> 08:44.560
I can testify.

08:45.720 --> 08:47.360
Within the palace,
treatment follows status.

08:48.280 --> 08:49.560
To curry favor with Empress Lv,

08:50.160 --> 08:52.640
they denied them food,
clothing, and all basic needs.

08:53.760 --> 08:55.640
Especially those
who were just taken away.

08:56.120 --> 08:56.960
They were the worst.

08:58.120 --> 08:59.120
I remember

08:59.760 --> 09:00.720
one bitter winter

09:01.520 --> 09:02.760
Prince Changjue fell seriously ill.

09:03.520 --> 09:04.760
He was freezing cold to the bone.

09:05.360 --> 09:06.960
The princess begged for medicine.

09:07.600 --> 09:09.680
But Empress Lv's attendants forced her
to kneel in supplication.

09:10.720 --> 09:11.480
Even then,

09:12.120 --> 09:14.280
she was refused.

09:14.680 --> 09:16.480
She cried all the way
back to the Cold Palace.

09:17.240 --> 09:18.800
I couldn't stand to watch it.

09:19.560 --> 09:22.040
I secretly brought her
charcoal and medicine.

09:22.880 --> 09:24.120
She tried to thank me,

09:24.640 --> 09:26.040
but she had nothing to offer.

09:26.880 --> 09:27.920
In that cold and desolate place,

09:28.200 --> 09:31.440
she didn't have even
a single decent thing to give.

09:34.160 --> 09:35.160
She and Prince Changjue were barely fed.

09:35.880 --> 09:37.800
Their meals were cut short

09:38.600 --> 09:39.400
on purpose.

09:40.520 --> 09:42.600
They were often harassed
and mocked for the amusement.

09:43.240 --> 09:44.200
Come and get it!

09:44.280 --> 09:45.080
Give it to me!

09:46.520 --> 09:47.320
Give it back!

09:48.320 --> 09:48.920
Stop!

09:53.120 --> 09:53.880
Beg for it.

09:54.280 --> 09:56.240
Beg, and I'll give it to you.

09:56.600 --> 09:57.600
Come on! Beg us for it!

09:59.200 --> 10:01.200
Who would've thought a princess

10:01.280 --> 10:03.240
would fight so desperately
over a single flatbread?

10:03.480 --> 10:04.520
Fine, have it then.

10:07.120 --> 10:08.400
Go pick it up, little beggar.

10:09.240 --> 10:10.040
Little beggar.

10:10.160 --> 10:12.240
Oh, little beggar.

10:14.080 --> 10:14.680
Your Highness!

10:15.800 --> 10:16.600
Your Highness, don't eat that.

10:20.200 --> 10:21.000
This is clean.

10:22.040 --> 10:22.880
Eat this.

10:28.520 --> 10:29.120
Since that day,

10:29.960 --> 10:31.560
I've had no further dealings
with Her Highness.

10:32.640 --> 10:33.360
As for what she did afterward,

10:33.880 --> 10:34.480
I…

10:34.920 --> 10:35.720
I truly do not know.

10:36.160 --> 10:36.760
Chancellor Shen.

10:36.880 --> 10:38.520
- Mercy, Chancellor Shen!
- Mercy, Chancellor Shen!

10:38.840 --> 10:39.440
Chancellor Shen.

10:39.520 --> 10:40.920
We know Her Highness
was guilty of some offense,

10:41.480 --> 10:43.680
but we only pitied the innocent child.

10:44.480 --> 10:45.720
Please judge fairly, Chancellor Shen.

10:48.120 --> 10:49.080
You did nothing wrong.

10:51.200 --> 10:52.280
What crime is there in that?

10:55.760 --> 10:56.680
Nothing wrong?

11:00.160 --> 11:01.000
If not for you,

11:02.160 --> 11:03.320
how could Her Highness have survived

11:03.920 --> 11:04.880
that man-eating harem?

11:07.240 --> 11:09.080
The Chancellor summoned you here
to Qi for one reason.

11:09.720 --> 11:11.120
To thank you in person.

11:11.560 --> 11:12.360
The Chancellor offers you a reward.

11:13.240 --> 11:13.840
These gold ingots

11:14.880 --> 11:15.520
are yours.

11:27.080 --> 11:27.680
Why the tears?

11:29.880 --> 11:30.840
I'm happy

11:32.360 --> 11:33.280
for the princess.

11:35.040 --> 11:36.080
She's finally found someone

11:37.360 --> 11:38.680
who truly cares for her.

11:40.600 --> 11:42.080
(Someone who cares for me?)

11:44.320 --> 11:45.400
(Shen Zaiye…)

11:54.080 --> 11:54.680
Men.

11:55.440 --> 11:56.200
See them out.

12:11.400 --> 12:12.000
Chancellor.

12:12.760 --> 12:13.600
Her Highness came by earlier.

12:20.840 --> 12:26.000
♪I'm lost for words when you turn away♪

12:27.000 --> 12:33.440
♪The closer our fluttering hearts
draw near, the more they try to hide♪

12:34.760 --> 12:41.080
♪The deeper my thoughts grow for you
at night♪

12:41.400 --> 12:46.440
♪The more afraid I am of losing you♪

12:48.160 --> 12:51.400
♪Those simple, ordinary days♪

12:51.480 --> 12:53.480
♪Feel like a dream of mine♪

12:53.560 --> 12:54.280
(You still refuse)

12:55.800 --> 12:57.720
(to see me…)

12:58.600 --> 13:01.520
♪Far away from worldly concerns♪

13:01.960 --> 13:06.120
♪Those memories become clear over time♪

13:06.200 --> 13:09.240
♪The long night passes in a flash♪

13:09.400 --> 13:12.800
♪Two hearts slowly connect♪

13:12.880 --> 13:16.800
♪They dance joyfully♪

13:37.040 --> 13:37.680
Miss Meng.

13:39.280 --> 13:40.120
What are you doing here?

13:43.200 --> 13:44.680
I meant to seek out His Highness,

13:45.280 --> 13:46.040
but I somehow

13:46.480 --> 13:47.960
lost my way in the residence.

13:48.480 --> 13:49.200
If that is the case,

13:49.640 --> 13:50.920
I shall take you to him.

13:52.520 --> 13:53.160
Thank you.

14:06.080 --> 14:06.680
Miss Meng.

14:07.200 --> 14:07.920
His Highness will be here shortly.

14:11.880 --> 14:12.520
What's wrong with you?

14:13.040 --> 14:13.920
Clumsy ox!

14:17.000 --> 14:18.160
(Coins?)

14:27.040 --> 14:28.040
What brings you here?

14:28.360 --> 14:28.960
Your Highness.

14:31.520 --> 14:32.680
Since I awoke,

14:32.960 --> 14:34.200
my mind has been muddled.

14:35.200 --> 14:36.200
But I just remembered.

14:36.920 --> 14:37.720
By etiquette,

14:38.080 --> 14:39.160
I should

14:39.240 --> 14:40.440
greet you daily.

14:41.520 --> 14:42.960
That is why I braved the rain
to come here.

14:43.520 --> 14:45.000
I hope you will not take offense.

14:47.760 --> 14:49.800
I've never cared for empty formalities.

14:50.640 --> 14:51.360
You need not come again
for such trivial matters.

14:54.280 --> 14:54.880
Yes, Your Highness.

14:55.680 --> 14:56.640
Then I shall take my leave.

15:11.920 --> 15:12.520
Hua.

15:16.840 --> 15:17.600
Has Jiang Taohua

15:18.480 --> 15:19.720
truly forgotten everything?

15:20.360 --> 15:21.280
Her mind's in turmoil.

15:22.400 --> 15:23.560
Right now,

15:24.440 --> 15:25.560
she obeys my every word.

15:29.920 --> 15:30.800
She's far more cunning than she seems.

15:33.320 --> 15:34.280
You mustn't let your guard down.

15:36.200 --> 15:37.080
I always do as you say.

15:37.680 --> 15:38.720
I shall be extremely careful.

16:00.360 --> 16:02.120
Present your memorial if you have one.

16:02.440 --> 16:04.520
If not, then court is adjourned.

16:08.880 --> 16:10.080
This weather's been

16:10.320 --> 16:11.240
as unpredictable

16:11.720 --> 16:13.560
as His Majesty's moods.

16:14.040 --> 16:14.680
Mr. Liu,

16:15.000 --> 16:16.200
mind your words.

16:16.360 --> 16:16.960
Vice Minister Qin.

16:17.200 --> 16:18.000
Please take a look at this.

16:18.720 --> 16:19.320
Deputy Minister Wang.

16:19.440 --> 16:20.160
This is a policy essay.

16:20.600 --> 16:22.040
I still have matters to attend to.

16:23.560 --> 16:24.280
Ministers.

16:24.920 --> 16:26.120
I have a policy essay right here.

16:26.640 --> 16:27.240
Could you…

16:27.320 --> 16:28.520
My apologies, Prince Wuxia.

16:28.920 --> 16:30.200
We have other matters to deal with.

16:37.280 --> 16:38.440
Your Highness, what troubles you?

16:43.520 --> 16:44.880
You're busy with state affairs.

16:45.640 --> 16:46.520
I won't trouble you

16:46.680 --> 16:47.520
with my personal matters.

16:48.680 --> 16:49.280
Let me see it.

16:53.280 --> 16:54.480
This is an excellent piece of writing.

16:55.240 --> 16:56.680
(Li Jiaohan)
Though, it may not be to your liking.

16:57.720 --> 16:58.720
What is Li Jiaohan's background

16:58.920 --> 17:00.360
and rank?

17:03.560 --> 17:04.359
No official post.

17:04.920 --> 17:05.720
Born into a farming household.

17:10.040 --> 17:10.800
A pity there's no one at court today

17:11.680 --> 17:13.760
with the eye to recognize such talent.

17:14.079 --> 17:15.440
You've wasted your effort.

17:32.840 --> 17:34.280
"No one at court today with the eye

17:34.920 --> 17:36.000
to recognize talent?"

17:53.000 --> 17:53.920
Such keen insight!

17:55.000 --> 17:55.800
Such noble spirit!

17:56.920 --> 17:57.960
Such a masterful treatise!

17:59.520 --> 18:00.600
You have a discerning eye, Mr. Gao.

18:01.240 --> 18:03.120
If Li Jiaohan were appointed to court,

18:03.480 --> 18:05.440
he could usher in a new sight for Qi.

18:07.560 --> 18:08.760
(Gao Yuan, Vice Minister of Personnel)
Huairui, bring tea.

18:08.840 --> 18:09.840
(Gao Yuan, Vice Minister of Personnel)

18:11.160 --> 18:11.760
Mr. Gao.

18:12.800 --> 18:14.120
If this man is given a post,

18:14.520 --> 18:16.600
he may become a pillar of our state.

18:17.360 --> 18:18.840
It is as Your Highness says.

18:19.280 --> 18:19.920
Do we know

18:20.280 --> 18:21.120
anything

18:21.360 --> 18:21.960
of Li Jiaohan's

18:22.200 --> 18:22.840
official record,

18:23.120 --> 18:23.720
conduct,

18:24.080 --> 18:25.000
and reputation?

18:26.280 --> 18:26.920
He

18:27.840 --> 18:29.160
is merely a farmer's son.

18:30.320 --> 18:31.920
He once offended a local magistrate

18:32.200 --> 18:33.200
due to his blunt temperament,

18:33.720 --> 18:35.800
which is why he has no rank.

18:36.080 --> 18:39.000
The entry point into service
is the ninth rank.

18:40.160 --> 18:41.600
But he has none.

18:42.120 --> 18:42.720
Shall I submit

18:43.680 --> 18:44.920
his name directly to my father

18:45.160 --> 18:45.760
so…

18:45.840 --> 18:46.440
That will not do.

18:46.680 --> 18:48.800
The court is dominated by noble clans.

18:49.320 --> 18:51.200
His Majesty only appointed
the Left Chancellor outside tradition

18:51.480 --> 18:53.080
to balance all factions.

18:53.640 --> 18:54.640
And even that

18:54.880 --> 18:56.080
has required great effort.

18:56.400 --> 18:57.280
There are many factors at play.

18:58.320 --> 18:59.480
If you raise the matter at court now,

18:59.960 --> 19:01.320
it may stir controversy.

19:02.760 --> 19:05.440
We might lose this talent entirely.

19:06.240 --> 19:08.440
But such talent is truly rare.

19:09.520 --> 19:10.480
Your Highness, please rest assured.

19:10.760 --> 19:11.560
I'll do everything in my power

19:12.000 --> 19:13.880
to recommend Li Jiaohan.

19:15.840 --> 19:16.520
I'll begin

19:16.640 --> 19:18.840
by arranging his preliminary rank,

19:19.800 --> 19:22.000
then promote him step by step.

19:22.560 --> 19:23.160
Is that agreeable?

19:24.320 --> 19:25.760
That does sound more prudent.

19:26.680 --> 19:27.880
Rest assured, Your Highness.

19:28.360 --> 19:29.760
I shall give my utmost

19:30.360 --> 19:32.320
to ensure Li Jiaohan enters officialdom.

19:33.400 --> 19:36.280
Though, there will still be much

19:36.920 --> 19:38.680
to handle behind the scenes.

19:44.280 --> 19:47.720
(Meng Huairui, Gao Yuan's Disciple)

20:03.520 --> 20:04.520
Where is Qingtai?

20:05.480 --> 20:06.080
Your Highness.

20:06.680 --> 20:08.080
Aside from bringing meals
to Jiang Taohua,

20:08.480 --> 20:09.680
she's kept herself to her quarters.

20:10.480 --> 20:11.800
Send her out of the residence
and place her under guard.

20:11.920 --> 20:12.520
Your Highness,

20:12.760 --> 20:13.640
what did she do wrong?

20:15.800 --> 20:16.920
Hua is here now.

20:17.880 --> 20:19.280
All the more reason to tread carefully.

20:21.120 --> 20:22.400
Safer to separate Jiang Taohua

20:23.400 --> 20:24.360
from Qingtai.

20:25.520 --> 20:27.080
Should we just…

20:34.320 --> 20:34.920
Not for now.

20:37.520 --> 20:39.320
Jiang Taohua is fond of that maid.

20:40.280 --> 20:40.880
She may

20:42.600 --> 20:43.800
prove useful down the line.

20:44.000 --> 20:44.600
Yes, Your Highness.

20:48.680 --> 20:49.280
Miss Meng.

20:50.720 --> 20:51.320
It's time for your meal.

20:52.680 --> 20:53.320
Where's Qingtai?

20:53.920 --> 20:55.440
His Highness has
other arrangements for her.

20:56.120 --> 20:57.880
From now on,
I'll be the one to deliver your meals.

20:58.760 --> 20:59.400
Forgive me

20:59.800 --> 21:00.880
if there is any inconvenience.

21:10.920 --> 21:11.520
Qingfeng.

21:13.280 --> 21:15.200
I'm entirely dependent
on Prince Wuyin now.

21:16.200 --> 21:19.080
In this residence,
I hold no standing whatsoever.

21:20.280 --> 21:21.920
And now I'm not even allowed

21:22.200 --> 21:23.440
to keep a maid by my side?

21:24.680 --> 21:25.400
Your Highness jests.

21:26.520 --> 21:27.600
His Highness holds you in high regard.

21:28.600 --> 21:29.320
You're the only lady

21:29.400 --> 21:30.120
ever permitted

21:30.840 --> 21:32.680
to reside here.

21:35.720 --> 21:36.720
Then you had best consider

21:37.520 --> 21:38.800
the consequences

21:39.160 --> 21:40.080
of offending me.

21:41.640 --> 21:42.760
I may have neither power nor rank,

21:43.080 --> 21:44.360
but if His Highness insisted
on keeping me here,

21:45.160 --> 21:46.800
it means I serve a purpose for him.

21:47.720 --> 21:49.920
It would be all too easy for me

21:50.200 --> 21:51.400
to whisper in his ear

21:51.800 --> 21:52.680
and cause you trouble.

21:54.240 --> 21:54.840
Miss Meng,

21:55.440 --> 21:56.120
may I ask

21:56.640 --> 21:57.320
what I did to offend you?

21:58.040 --> 21:58.640
Answer me.

21:59.280 --> 22:00.520
Is Qingtai dead or alive?

22:00.680 --> 22:01.360
Where is she?

22:06.320 --> 22:06.920
Miss Meng,

22:07.560 --> 22:08.320
I can only tell you this.

22:09.000 --> 22:10.520
Miss Qingtai is alive and well.

22:11.520 --> 22:12.320
I simply can't tell you

22:12.920 --> 22:13.720
anything more

22:14.080 --> 22:14.680
than that.

22:16.160 --> 22:16.760
You're dismissed.

22:25.320 --> 22:27.040
(Judging by his expression,
he isn't lying.)

22:27.920 --> 22:29.600
(But Qingtai is still missing.)

22:31.040 --> 22:32.600
(I must find a way to locate her.)

22:46.560 --> 22:47.240
Are you Jiaohan?

22:49.160 --> 22:49.960
My name is Meng Huairui.

22:50.440 --> 22:51.400
I study under Vice Minister Gao.

22:52.400 --> 22:53.120
Mr. Meng.

22:54.520 --> 22:56.200
What brings you to me at this hour?

22:56.800 --> 22:57.840
Please be seated.

23:00.480 --> 23:01.080
Jiaohan.

23:01.960 --> 23:04.760
First, allow me to wish you
great success in your future career.

23:05.680 --> 23:06.600
What are you saying?

23:07.240 --> 23:07.840
I'm merely

23:08.280 --> 23:09.320
a humble commoner.

23:11.240 --> 23:12.080
Jiaohan.

23:12.680 --> 23:14.080
I just told you.

23:14.320 --> 23:15.440
I study under Vice Minister Gao.

23:16.040 --> 23:18.840
Do you not understand the implication?

23:19.720 --> 23:21.680
Vice Minister Gao's an upright official,
eager to cultivate talent,

23:22.320 --> 23:23.080
and well-respected for his integrity.

23:23.680 --> 23:24.920
He has a discerning eye for talent.

23:25.480 --> 23:27.080
And you are gifted.

23:27.640 --> 23:29.040
He has already read your work

23:30.120 --> 23:31.160
and was deeply impressed.

23:31.920 --> 23:33.600
That is why he sent me to meet you.

23:35.280 --> 23:36.120
Mr. Mu did…

23:37.400 --> 23:38.520
Prince Wuxia is indeed true to his word.

23:38.640 --> 23:40.320
This matter must still pass
through Mr. Gao's hands.

23:40.920 --> 23:41.680
However…

23:43.200 --> 23:43.800
However what?

23:44.480 --> 23:46.360
The scope of your writing is too broad.

23:46.800 --> 23:47.960
It touches heavily
on noble families and matters of state.

23:48.520 --> 23:50.920
His Majesty may find it difficult
to act on such proposals all at once.

23:52.320 --> 23:53.600
Why not start with something smaller?

23:55.440 --> 23:56.160
Smaller?

23:59.840 --> 24:00.640
Perhaps a concise,

24:00.720 --> 24:02.240
sharp political essay.

24:02.600 --> 24:04.320
That way,
when Mr. Gao presents it to His Majesty,

24:04.640 --> 24:06.080
it will demonstrate

24:06.320 --> 24:06.920
your skill

24:07.160 --> 24:08.840
and avoid

24:09.200 --> 24:10.520
offending any noble clans.

24:11.400 --> 24:12.120
That's no trouble at all.

24:12.600 --> 24:14.320
I can write such a piece on the spot.

24:16.120 --> 24:17.320
If only I had brush

24:17.680 --> 24:18.280
and ink…

24:19.800 --> 24:20.520
Jiaohan, observe.

24:21.080 --> 24:22.120
I've prepared everything for you.

24:22.600 --> 24:23.200
Please.

24:46.920 --> 24:47.680
Thank you.

24:48.360 --> 24:48.960
Wait to hear good news from me.

24:50.200 --> 24:50.920
Thank you, Huairui.

25:00.320 --> 25:01.520
Ugh, I already told him to cut down

25:01.880 --> 25:03.040
on all the rambling.

25:03.320 --> 25:04.200
I'm going to be exhausted from all this.

25:11.720 --> 25:13.960
I still have to handwrite
the whole thing before I can use it.

25:14.760 --> 25:16.080
But once I've got it all copied,

25:18.000 --> 25:18.920
then…

25:32.160 --> 25:33.400
(Did she overhear my interrogation)

25:34.360 --> 25:36.440
(of the Beiyuan delegation that day?)

25:39.320 --> 25:40.520
(If she did,)

25:42.680 --> 25:43.960
(what must she think?)

25:54.840 --> 25:55.440
Chancellor,

25:55.760 --> 25:56.920
the men we stationed to watch

25:57.320 --> 25:59.120
report that Prince Wuyin has left
the residence in a carriage.

25:59.680 --> 26:00.520
Her Highness was not with him.

26:24.840 --> 26:25.880
Seems you're not quite as docile

26:26.480 --> 26:27.840
in this residence as you pretended to be

26:28.080 --> 26:29.240
when I last visited.

26:31.200 --> 26:32.080
Why are you

26:33.080 --> 26:33.760
in that attire?

26:34.920 --> 26:36.000
I've come with questions for you.

26:43.760 --> 26:44.960
Miss Meng,
you're still awake at this hour.

26:45.280 --> 26:46.080
Is something troubling you?

26:46.360 --> 26:46.960
I'm fine.

26:47.680 --> 26:48.800
I was just admiring the moon outside.

26:49.280 --> 26:50.200
I shall retire now.

26:50.680 --> 26:51.440
You may go.

26:59.920 --> 27:00.520
Chancellor Shen.

27:01.320 --> 27:03.000
How much more trouble
do you plan to bring me?

27:04.400 --> 27:05.000
From now on,

27:05.920 --> 27:06.920
I'll only solve your troubles.

27:11.800 --> 27:13.640
Do you genuinely believe
that intimidating and rewarding

27:13.720 --> 27:14.520
the Beiyuan delegation

27:14.840 --> 27:15.920
will rid me of my problems?

27:17.680 --> 27:18.320
Jiang Taohua,

27:19.320 --> 27:20.240
this is only the beginning.

27:21.200 --> 27:22.680
Every wrong done to you,

27:23.120 --> 27:23.800
every humiliation and threat,

27:24.600 --> 27:26.400
I'll see that justice is served
for each and every one.

27:28.040 --> 27:29.400
Until the poison
of the Jiangtao pill is removed.

27:30.200 --> 27:31.520
Until Changjue is safe and sound.

27:33.800 --> 27:34.520
How did you know?

27:38.040 --> 27:39.360
I only regret learning too late

27:41.000 --> 27:42.040
and letting you suffer so much.

27:43.920 --> 27:45.240
What is the true nature
of our relationship?

27:48.400 --> 27:49.440
When I first arrived in Yujing,

27:50.320 --> 27:51.760
did we truly share such intimacy?

27:55.000 --> 27:56.240
Do you truly not remember anything?

28:04.520 --> 28:05.880
The entire court was shaken.

28:07.200 --> 28:09.080
Petitions impeaching me flooded in.

28:10.400 --> 28:11.440
You failed to marry Prince Wuxia,

28:11.920 --> 28:12.880
and so were sent to my residence.

28:13.080 --> 28:13.680
Impossible!

28:14.520 --> 28:15.880
Even if I'm here only
for the sake of a political marriage,

28:16.880 --> 28:18.600
I'm still the rightful
Princess Chengping of Beiyuan.

28:19.240 --> 28:20.080
When I first arrived in Yujing,

28:20.520 --> 28:21.520
I was placed
in Prince Wuyin's residence.

28:22.120 --> 28:23.280
I was promised to him.

28:25.760 --> 28:26.680
Promised to Prince Wuyin?

28:28.240 --> 28:29.120
Is that what he told you?

28:29.200 --> 28:30.040
That's what I remember.

28:33.440 --> 28:34.680
Though much of what happened
after I arrived in Qi

28:35.680 --> 28:36.360
remains unclear to me.

28:39.000 --> 28:39.640
What else do you remember?

28:40.280 --> 28:41.120
Tell me everything in detail.

28:48.680 --> 28:49.320
I remember

28:50.840 --> 28:52.680
Prince Wuyin playing the guqin for me
on a tall platform.

28:53.520 --> 28:54.960
I remember his smiling face.

28:55.840 --> 28:56.440
I remember…

28:58.840 --> 28:59.600
And do I appear

29:00.800 --> 29:01.400
in those memories?

29:03.840 --> 29:06.480
(Since you arrived in Yujing,
you've consorted with another man.)

29:15.040 --> 29:16.520
(Trust no one.)

29:18.920 --> 29:19.520
Leave.

29:20.520 --> 29:21.120
Leave here at once.

29:27.760 --> 29:28.800
Where is Qingtai?

29:30.240 --> 29:31.600
I was just out looking for her.

29:32.800 --> 29:33.600
Is she still in the residence?

29:34.520 --> 29:35.120
I'm not sure.

29:36.120 --> 29:36.960
She told me

29:38.120 --> 29:39.680
she was helping in the alchemy room.

29:41.520 --> 29:42.120
Wait here.

29:42.400 --> 29:43.000
I'll go find her.

29:43.880 --> 29:44.520
I'm coming with you.

29:48.240 --> 29:48.840
All right.

29:50.120 --> 29:51.000
Once we find her,

29:51.600 --> 29:52.640
the truth will come to light.

29:54.160 --> 29:54.760
Jiang Taohua,

29:55.640 --> 29:56.600
I know you're scared.

29:58.520 --> 29:59.240
Just remember,

30:00.120 --> 30:01.040
no matter what,

30:02.520 --> 30:03.960
you can always trust me.

30:44.880 --> 30:45.640
She's not here either.

30:46.680 --> 30:48.000
She wasn't in the alchemy room
or the furnace room.

30:48.440 --> 30:49.680
There's no trace of her anywhere.

30:50.120 --> 30:51.720
Is she maybe
not in the residence at all?

30:55.880 --> 30:56.560
Let's search elsewhere.

31:03.800 --> 31:04.400
Who goes there?

31:24.520 --> 31:25.600
(Boshan incense?)

31:29.000 --> 31:31.000
(I've smelled this scent before.)

31:32.320 --> 31:34.760
(On someone I know very well.)

32:05.200 --> 32:06.400
Maybe you were mistaken.

32:06.800 --> 32:08.120
Come on. Let's go. There's no one here.

32:12.880 --> 32:14.080
There's one place in the residence
we haven't searched.

32:14.880 --> 32:15.480
Follow me.

32:32.360 --> 32:33.920
This is Prince Wuyin's bedchamber.

32:34.520 --> 32:35.120
Is there a place

32:35.720 --> 32:36.520
to hide someone in here?

32:37.080 --> 32:38.080
I've been here before

32:38.680 --> 32:40.000
and noticed nothing unusual.

32:41.320 --> 32:42.280
Many nobles build hidden rooms

32:42.760 --> 32:44.080
within their bedchambers.

32:44.680 --> 32:45.320
Did you notice anything odd

32:45.640 --> 32:46.800
during your previous visit?

32:56.520 --> 32:57.120
Coins.

32:58.000 --> 32:59.240
A prince like Prince Wuyin

32:59.440 --> 33:00.640
should have no need for them.

33:01.480 --> 33:03.120
Yet he keeps many here

33:03.520 --> 33:04.320
and stores them with great care.

33:05.160 --> 33:05.760
Where are they?

33:06.000 --> 33:06.600
Follow me.

33:11.480 --> 33:12.080
Who's there?

33:15.480 --> 33:16.160
Who goes there?

33:18.520 --> 33:19.160
I'll distract them.

33:19.760 --> 33:20.600
Keep yourself safe

33:21.080 --> 33:22.080
until we find Qingtai.

33:29.480 --> 33:30.080
Stop!

33:30.400 --> 33:31.000
Stop right there!

33:35.760 --> 33:37.520
(It's that stabbing pain again.)

33:41.080 --> 33:42.800
(Why do I feel so sad every time)

33:43.520 --> 33:44.880
(I see his back?)

33:47.800 --> 33:48.640
(Pull yourself together,)

33:49.760 --> 33:50.520
(Jiang Taohua!)

33:54.960 --> 33:55.640
He went that way!

33:55.960 --> 33:57.000
Stop, thief!

34:02.920 --> 34:03.520
This must be the mechanism

34:04.280 --> 34:06.280
that opens the hidden chamber.

34:07.360 --> 34:08.280
This pattern…

34:09.440 --> 34:10.280
Is this the Bagua formation?

34:12.440 --> 34:13.719
The Bagua formation
is divided into eight gates.

34:15.480 --> 34:16.960
(Xiu, Sheng, Shang,)

34:17.800 --> 34:19.480
(Du, Jing, Si, and Kai.)

34:20.480 --> 34:22.159
(Enter through
the Sheng gate from the east)

34:22.639 --> 34:24.239
(and strike from the Kai gate
in the north,)

34:24.840 --> 34:25.639
(then the door will open.)

34:36.360 --> 34:37.000
(Strange.)

34:37.719 --> 34:38.719
(Nothing is happening.)

34:41.080 --> 34:42.360
(What if I reverse the order?)

34:44.679 --> 34:45.920
(I'll try starting from the Si gate.)

34:47.280 --> 34:47.960
(The Si gate.)

34:48.719 --> 34:49.800
(Its palace position is Kun.)

34:50.400 --> 34:51.199
(It symbolizes the feminine.)

34:52.400 --> 34:54.719
(Word is, Prince Wuyin and his sister
have always depended on each other.)

34:55.560 --> 34:56.600
(Could the key to this puzzle lie)

34:57.440 --> 34:58.600
(in the Kun palace?)

35:04.480 --> 35:05.080
(It worked!)

35:31.040 --> 35:31.880
(Strange.)

35:32.760 --> 35:33.800
(This is clearly a hidden chamber,)

35:34.680 --> 35:36.080
(yet it's decorated so lavishly.)

35:36.440 --> 35:37.040
(Happiness)

35:37.120 --> 35:38.480
(It looks more like a bridal chamber.)

35:41.640 --> 35:42.240
(Wait.)

35:43.080 --> 35:43.680
(That's…)

35:50.880 --> 35:52.040
(This bracelet…)

35:53.560 --> 35:55.600
(Where have I seen it before?)

36:05.480 --> 36:06.760
(The bracelet belongs to Empress Lv.)

36:28.040 --> 36:28.640
Hua,

36:30.200 --> 36:32.280
all that you see

36:34.160 --> 36:35.680
will one day be yours.

37:15.920 --> 37:19.120
♪The flower bloomed,
knowing nothing at all♪

37:19.200 --> 37:22.240
♪In splendor, proud and tall♪

37:23.160 --> 37:26.280
♪The flower fell, lashed by the wind♪

37:26.400 --> 37:30.160
♪In a daze,
it felt like lifetimes had thinned♪

37:30.440 --> 37:33.520
♪Petals soaked in rain♪

37:33.640 --> 37:36.960
♪Heartbreak follows again and again♪

37:37.360 --> 37:40.920
♪The flower weeps, burdened by thoughts♪

37:41.000 --> 37:46.720
♪With no one it can be brought♪

37:51.680 --> 37:58.600
♪Wishes struggle through the mire♪

37:59.040 --> 38:05.880
♪Regrets clash in hopeless fire♪

38:06.360 --> 38:13.360
♪Still I hope she'll pick the flower
kissed by dew♪

38:13.680 --> 38:17.720
♪Even if it means this flower♪

38:17.840 --> 38:24.800
♪Will be hers to give to someone new♪

38:35.920 --> 38:39.040
♪Whose eyes
did the flower's heart meet?♪

38:39.120 --> 38:42.360
♪Love and hate held back, discreet♪

38:42.720 --> 38:46.400
♪The flower withers, feelings in decay♪

38:46.520 --> 38:53.080
♪No longer needing to say♪

38:57.160 --> 39:04.080
♪Yet I still long for her in madness♪

39:04.480 --> 39:11.440
♪Unafraid of judgment or sadness♪

39:11.800 --> 39:18.800
♪Remembering the words
she spoke of flowers and skies♪

39:19.160 --> 39:20.840
♪And finding♪

39:20.920 --> 39:27.920
♪They were her gentle heart's reply♪
